  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exiting Poverty in Rwanda Monitoring and Evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to support FCDO and Government of Rwanda to monitor and assess progress against the implementation of the national Social Protection Programme, to assess its effectiveness in reducing poverty and vulnerability in Rwanda, and to generate evidence and learning that will help improve the Programme and strengthen social protection policy and programming in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
